    "Notice of Punishment": {
        "content": "{{>header\r\n    title=\"Notice of Punishment\"\r\n    department=\"TFU Quality Assurance\"\r\n}}\r\n\r\nHello **{{officer_name}}**,<br/>\r\n\r\nThis message serves as a notice of punishment following a recent investigation conducted by the Tactical Firearms Unit Command Team. This decision wasn't made in a hurry, an in depth investigation and discussion have taken place and TFU Command have deemed your actions do not represent the qualities we expect from members of our unit.<br/><br/>\r\n\r\n<b>What happened: **{{what_happened}}**</b><br/>\r\n<b>Disciplinary grading: **{{grading}}**</b><br/>\r\n<b>Points issued:\r\n{{#if (eq grading \"1\")}}\r\n1\r\n{{else if (eq grading \"2\")}}\r\n2\r\n{{else if (eq grading \"3.1\")}}\r\n3\r\n{{else}}\r\n4\r\n{{/if}}\r\n</b><br/>\r\n<b>Date of point expiry: **{{expiry_point}}**</b><br/>\r\n\r\nIf you wish to dispute this disciplinary action, you may do so by directing a helpdesk to TFU and the Head of TFU will deal with it. If this punishment was decided from an Internal affairs complaint that you are actively disputing, the punishment will remain until the verdict is decided. At which point the decision of the dispute will dictate whether it is removed or not.<br/><br/>\r\n\r\n<b>Regards,</b><br/>\r\nLieutenant Tyler Bounce<br/>\r\nStaff Sergeant Vina Yin<br/>\r\n<b>TFU Quality Assurance</b>\r\n",
