    "Activity Warning": {
        "content": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n    <img src=\"https://plpd.online/images/swat.png\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto;\" width=\"164\" height=\"164\"/><br/>\r\n{{#if (eq strike \"3\")}}\r\n<b>Activity Warning - Removal</b><br/>\r\n{{else}}\r\n    <b>Activity Warning - Strike {{strike}}</b><br/>\r\n{{/if}}\r\n    <b>TFU Quality Assurance</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\nHello **{{officer_name}}**,<br/>\r\n\r\n{{#if (eq strike \"3\")}}\r\nThis message serves as a formal notice of disciplinary action due to insufficient activity while on duty as a {{certification}}. As this marks your third and final point of contact regarding this issue, it has resulted in your demotion from the {{certification}} certification to the {{new_certification}} certification.<br/><br/>\r\n{{else}}\r\nThis message serves as a notice of punishment due to insufficient activity whilst on duty as a {{certification}}. Your punishment is the following:<br/>\r\n\r\n<b>Points issued: {{strike}}</b><br/>\r\n<b>Date of point expiry: {{expiry_point}}</b><br/><br/>\r\n{{/if}}\r\n\r\nIf you wish to dispute this disciplinary action, you may do so by directing a helpdesk to TFU and the Head of TFU will deal with it.<br/><br/>\r\n\r\n<b>Regards,</b><br/>\r\nLieutenant Tyler Bounce<br/>\r\nStaff Sergeant Vina Yin<br/>\r\n<b>TFU Quality Assurance</b>\r\n",
