    "Application Authenticity": {
        "content": "{{>header\r\n    title=\"Application Authenticity\"\r\n    department=\"TFU Recruitment\"\r\n}}\r\n\r\nHello <b>{{officer_name}}</b>,<br/><br/>\r\n\r\nWe, the Tactical Firearms Command team, were informed of an anomaly during the grading process of your TFU Application.<br/><br/>\r\n\r\nTherefore, the question we want to ask, in which we expect full honesty from you:\r\n<blockquote>\r\n{{question}}\r\n</blockquote><br/><br/>\r\n\r\n\r\nYou have the right to refuse providing a statement, however by doing so or failing to provide a statement will likely result in formal punishment being issued from TFU Command.<br/><br/>\r\n\r\nYou have <b>72 hours</b> to make a decision or provide a statement.<br/><br/>\r\n\r\nWe expect to hear from you soon.<br/><br/>\r\n\r\n<b>Regards,</b><br/>\r\nLieutenant Ryan Winters<br/>\r\nStaff Sergeant Jonathan Gin<br/>\r\nStaff Sergeant Vina Yin<br/>\r\n<b>TFU Recruitment</b>\r\n",
