    "Let's Talk": {
        "content": "{{>header\r\n    title=\"Let's Talk\"\r\n    department=\"Tactical Firearms Unit\"\r\n}}\r\n\r\nHello **{{officer_name}}**,<br/>\r\n\r\nThis is an 'informal warning'. Please remember that we don't keep this on record, and that it is simply a measure used to, in partnership, avoid escalation of performance related matters, and ensure that everything is on the right track!<br/><br/>\r\n\r\n<b>Performance area(s) for review:</b><br/>\r\n{{area}}<br/><br/>\r\n\r\n<b>Considerations for improvement:</b><br/>\r\n{{improvement}}<br/><br/>\r\n\r\n<b>Date for review: {{review_date}}</b><br/><br/>\r\n\r\nI need to know your thoughts on what has been discussed above. I also need you to let me know if there is anything or anybody that may be responsible for unsatisfactory performance. I will try my best to support you.<br/><br/>\r\n\r\n<b>Regards,</b><br/>\r\n{{sender_rank}} {{sender_name}}<br/>\r\n{{sender_role}}\r\n",
